582: 
583: | # | Item | Decision taken | Recorded in |
584: |---|---|---|---|
585: | 1 | Current configuration index persistence unstated by Milan | **Persist** (least surprise across power cycles) | 07 §5 |
586: | 2 | AEM status for lock violation unspecified by Milan | Use IEEE `ENTITY_LOCKED` (3) | 06 §6.8 |
